  sentences:
  - text: "Merci d\u2019avoir pris le temps de r\xE9pondre \xE0 mes questions"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: Oliver
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Pas de probl\xE8me, n\u2019h\xE9sitez pas \xE0 me contacter si besoin."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 772b40428ba65d143bf3d00500b6573e, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Ah\u202F!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb78998e8e801c943a05166514b4b2f8, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "J\u2019y pense, j\u2019ai crois\xE9 un homme avant de venir qui m\u2019a
      demand\xE9 que vous le contactez. Je crois qu\u2019il s\u2019agit du cuisiner\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1ea30fb2f07ec84382ca382ddb38ca8, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Le cuisinier\u202F? Tr\xE8s bien, je le ferais. Merci \xE0 vous."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: Cuisinier
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
